The files mv_progs.c and mv_names.h in this directory come from Eric Brombaugh's g081_audio
(https://github.com/emeb/g081_audio, Firmware/mv_comp), under the MIT licence below. mv_progs.c was
generated there by the compiler in his MIDIVerb_RE (https://github.com/emeb/MIDIVerb_RE) from the
program ROM of the Alesis MIDIVerb (1986); the algorithms are Alesis's. SM-87's changes to them are
marked at their top.

